WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

intro.1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:07.280
Welcome. This video shows you how to start with the Work Demand and Muster Roll apps.

intro.2
00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:12.040
Go slowly. Pause the video at any time.

intro.3
00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:16.840
All names and places in this video are practice examples.

intro.4
00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:29.440
Remember the order. Sign in to the portal. Choose your area. Wait for the download. Then create the Work Demand.

download.title
00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:33.440
Step 1. Download the apps.

download.1
00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:38.800
Open the download page: <b>changtey.github.io/Worker-Demand-releases</b>

download.2
00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:43.200
For the office computer, choose <b>Download for Windows</b>.

download.3
00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:47.520
For your phone, choose <b>Download for Android</b>.

install.title
00:00:47.760 --> 00:00:52.080
Step 2. Install the app on Windows.

install.1
00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:57.800
Open Downloads. Double-click the file that ends with <b>Setup</b>.

install.2
00:00:58.040 --> 00:01:03.440
Windows may warn you about an unknown app. Read the message.

install.3
00:01:03.680 --> 00:01:08.680
If the file came from our download page, let the installer continue.

install.4
00:01:08.920 --> 00:01:11.720
Never turn off Windows protection.

install.5
00:01:11.960 --> 00:01:17.240
Choose <b>Install</b>. When the bar is full, choose <b>Finish</b>.

install.6
00:01:17.480 --> 00:01:23.400
Later, find VBGRAMG DEO Assistant in the Start menu.

google.title
00:01:23.640 --> 00:01:27.880
Step 3. Sign in to the app with Google.

google.1
00:01:28.120 --> 00:01:31.400
Open the app and choose <b>Sign in with Google</b>.

google.2
00:01:31.640 --> 00:01:36.760
Your web browser opens. Choose your Google account there.

google.3
00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:44.040
This sign-in is only for the app. It is not your VBGRAMG portal login.

area.title
00:01:44.280 --> 00:01:48.280
Step 4. Choose your login area.

area.1
00:01:48.520 --> 00:01:51.240
Now you see <b>Select login area</b>.

area.2
00:01:51.480 --> 00:01:53.120
Choose your <b>State</b>.

area.3
00:01:53.360 --> 00:01:58.720
Choose the <b>Financial Year</b>. It runs from April to March.

area.4
00:01:58.960 --> 00:02:02.560
Then choose your <b>District</b> and <b>Block</b>.

area.5
00:02:02.800 --> 00:02:07.760
This tick lets the app save your User ID and password safely.

area.6
00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:11.280
Choose <b>Save and open login page</b>.

portal.title
00:02:11.520 --> 00:02:16.600
Step 5. Sign in to VBGRAMG yourself.

portal.1
00:02:16.840 --> 00:02:22.000
The official VBGRAMG login page opens in the app's <b>Browser</b>.

portal.2
00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:28.640
We recommend: sign in with your own VBGRAMG account, for your own area.

portal.3
00:02:28.880 --> 00:02:37.560
Then the app can download your area's records. Downloading is free. It uses no Balance.

portal.4
00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:41.280
Type your <b>User ID</b> and <b>Password</b> yourself.

portal.5
00:02:41.520 --> 00:02:46.760
Type the <b>Security Code</b> yourself. Then press <b>Login</b>.

portal.6
00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:50.720
The app never saves the Security Code.

tour.title
00:02:50.960 --> 00:02:54.920
Step 6. Read the Welcome tour.

tour.1
00:02:55.160 --> 00:02:59.320
After sign-in, <b>Work Demand</b> opens at <b>Create demand</b>.

tour.2
00:02:59.560 --> 00:03:03.440
The first time, a short <b>Welcome tour</b> opens.

tour.3
00:03:03.680 --> 00:03:07.280
Press <b>Next</b> to see the next screen.

tour.4
00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:10.920
Press <b>Back</b> to go back.

tour.5
00:03:11.160 --> 00:03:16.880
Press <b>Skip tour</b> to close it. <b>Quick guide</b> can open it again.

village.title
00:03:17.120 --> 00:03:21.560
Step 7. Choose your Panchayat and Village.

village.1
00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:27.320
Check your State, Financial Year, District and Block.

village.2
00:03:27.560 --> 00:03:29.320
Choose your <b>Panchayat</b>.

village.3
00:03:29.560 --> 00:03:31.520
Then choose your <b>Village</b>.

village.4
00:03:31.760 --> 00:03:35.680
The app remembers this choice for next time.

wait.title
00:03:35.920 --> 00:03:40.240
Step 8. Wait for the download to finish.

wait.1
00:03:40.480 --> 00:03:47.880
Now your Village's records download by themselves. There is no download button to press.

wait.2
00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:54.240
First the bar may say <b>Finding download totals</b>. The app is counting.

wait.3
00:03:54.480 --> 00:04:04.680
Then the percent goes up as records are saved.

wait.4
00:04:04.920 --> 00:04:09.040
Wait for <b>100%</b> and <b>Download: Completed</b>.

wait.5
00:04:09.280 --> 00:04:13.720
When you see <b>Ready to prepare Work Demand</b>, you can start.

wait.6
00:04:13.960 --> 00:04:19.440
If a download stops, the app tries again by itself within two minutes.

wait.7
00:04:19.680 --> 00:04:27.200
Signed in, area chosen, download finished. Now create the Work Demand.

workers.title
00:04:27.440 --> 00:04:31.120
Step 9. Choose the workers.

workers.1
00:04:31.360 --> 00:04:33.320
Go down to <b>Workers</b>.

workers.2
00:04:33.560 --> 00:04:39.240
To find a person, type a name or Job Card number in the search box.

workers.3
00:04:39.480 --> 00:04:43.200
Tick the box of each worker who asked for work.

workers.4
00:04:43.440 --> 00:04:47.200
To choose everyone in the list, press <b>Select all</b>.

workers.5
00:04:47.440 --> 00:04:51.640
Only workers who pass the required checks can be chosen.

workers.6
00:04:51.880 --> 00:05:00.120
For example eKYC, the identity check, and ABPS, the Aadhaar payment system.

days.title
00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:04.360
Step 10. Enter the days and dates.

days.1
00:05:04.600 --> 00:05:06.600
Go to <b>Days and dates</b>.

days.2
00:05:06.840 --> 00:05:11.480
Check the <b>Application Date</b>, the day the workers asked for work.

days.3
00:05:11.720 --> 00:05:17.840
Type the days once in <b>No of Days</b>. Every selected worker gets them.

days.4
00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:23.480
In phone requests and the Android app, <b>Apply Days to All</b> does this.

days.5
00:05:23.720 --> 00:05:29.000
Choose the <b>Start Date</b>. The app fills in the <b>End Date</b>.

check.title
00:05:29.240 --> 00:05:32.800
Step 11. Check the demand.

check.1
00:05:33.040 --> 00:05:34.720
Press <b>Check demand</b>.

check.2
00:05:34.960 --> 00:05:40.720
Read the result. A problem shows the worker's name and the reason.

check.3
00:05:40.960 --> 00:05:46.080
Fix it, or press <b>Remove</b> to take that worker out of this demand.

check.4
00:05:46.320 --> 00:05:51.400
Saved records stay. Then press <b>Check demand</b> again.

check.5
00:05:51.640 --> 00:05:55.520
With no problems, you see <b>Demand checked</b>.

send.title
00:05:55.760 --> 00:06:00.160
Step 12. Send to VBGRAMG.

send.1
00:06:00.400 --> 00:06:03.040
Press <b>Send to VBGRAMG</b>.

send.2
00:06:03.280 --> 00:06:09.200
The app enters the demands on the portal for you. Watch the progress here.

send.3
00:06:09.440 --> 00:06:15.680
If the portal asks you to sign in, or for a Security Code, do it yourself.

send.4
00:06:15.920 --> 00:06:20.640
If the portal shows a final <b>Submit</b> button, press it yourself.

send.5
00:06:20.880 --> 00:06:25.840
Keep the app open and the computer awake until it finishes.

result.title
00:06:26.080 --> 00:06:29.760
Step 13. Read the result.

result.1
00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:33.240
At the end, a result box opens.

result.2
00:06:33.480 --> 00:06:37.240
<b>Entry steps finished</b> counts the forms the app filled.

result.3
00:06:37.480 --> 00:06:41.400
<b>Saved demands confirmed</b> is the real saved count.

result.4
00:06:41.640 --> 00:06:48.760
Here they differ, so press <b>Check saved results</b>. It does not send the demand again.

result.5
00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:56.000
If a result is unclear, check first. Never send the same demand twice.

android.title
00:06:56.240 --> 00:07:00.480
Step 14. Use the Android phone app.

android.1
00:07:00.720 --> 00:07:06.240
On a phone, install the <b>Worker Demand</b> app from the same download page.

android.2
00:07:06.480 --> 00:07:12.800
Get your private login code from the office and sign in. Keep it secret.

android.3
00:07:13.040 --> 00:07:15.440
Tap <b>Create work request</b>.

android.4
00:07:15.680 --> 00:07:21.160
Tick the workers. Type the days and tap <b>Apply Days to All</b>.

android.5
00:07:21.400 --> 00:07:26.000
Check the request. Then tap <b>Send to office</b>.

android.6
00:07:26.240 --> 00:07:29.520
Open <b>History</b> to see what the office did.

android.7
00:07:29.760 --> 00:07:37.040
A phone request is not an official Work Demand. The office checks it first.

help.title
00:07:37.280 --> 00:07:40.480
Step 15. Get help.

help.1
00:07:40.720 --> 00:07:47.600
Questions? Ask in our WhatsApp group. The link is on your screen.

help.2
00:07:47.840 --> 00:07:52.680
This is an independent app. It is not a government app.

help.3
00:07:52.920 --> 00:08:00.080
Thank you for watching. Go one step at a time.
